node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
*.local

# `tauri icon` emits mobile icon sets too. This app is Windows-only (ConPTY), and
# they regenerate from app-icon.svg, so there is nothing to gain from tracking them.
src-tauri/icons/android/
src-tauri/icons/ios/

# Alternate release output used when the normal executable is running.
src-tauri/target-ui-layout/
src-tauri/target-ui-v2/

# Shared-brain runtime data. Written into whichever project is active; when that
# project is Mosaic itself, it's just scratch from a test run.
.mosaic/

# Per-machine tool settings
.claude/settings.local.json

# Internal improvement audit. Deliberately untracked: it is an itemized list of
# known-unfixed weaknesses in this app (isolation that fails open, guessable task
# IDs, full environment inheritance into spawned processes, no real auth on the
# MCP ports). Publishing it in a public repo hands that list to anyone running a
# version that predates the fixes. Keep it local until the findings are closed;
# track only a sanitized roadmap.
IMPROVEMENT-AUDIT.md

